cvmcrypt
========

This library is written from scratch for the cvm runtime. Portions of
the algorithm implementations are carried over, rewritten to cvm's
coding conventions, from the following projects:

  * libtomcrypt (develop branch, v1.18.2-1245-g6c6d510)
    — Unlicense (public domain)
    — ciphers, AEAD, hashes, MACs, key exchange, public-key primitives,
      ASN.1/DER, algorithm registry

  * Mbed TLS 3.6.7
    — Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later; we take it under Apache-2.0
    — bignum (library/bignum*.c), X.509 parsing and chain validation
      (library/x509*.c), ASN.1 (library/asn1parse.c), OID tables
      (library/oid.c), platform utilities (library/platform_util.c)

  * cvm (vendor/cvm submodule)
    — the rt/ platform layer this library references; same project
    — vm/mem.c, adapted here as src/base/mem.c

Each source file records where it came from in its header comment.
Files derived from Mbed TLS carry its copyright notice and
SPDX-License-Identifier; the Apache-2.0 text is in LICENSE-APACHE.
